    <string name="onerom_changelog_title">OneROM Changelog</string>
    <string name="onerom_changelog_summary">Detailed technical release notes and version history</string>
    <string name="onerom_changelog_900_title">OneROM 9.0 (Current)</string>
    <string name="onerom_changelog_900_summary">• Platform: One UI 8.5 foundation (Android 16, SDK 36).\n• Settings &amp; Connections: Fixed main-thread hang in TetheringManager and restored instant Connections navigation.\n• Device Care: Restored native SmartManager_v5 (com.samsung.android.lool) as privileged package.\n• Display: Restored dynamic Screen Resolution switcher (HD+, FHD+, WQHD+) and removed obsolete 120Hz Motion Smoothness.\n• Status Bar: Lowered status bar vertical margin to center icons around front camera punch hole.\n• Kernel &amp; Root: Integrated OneKernel v3.2.0+ with KernelSU Next and userspace ksud daemon.</string>
    <string name="onerom_changelog_850_title">OneROM 8.5.0.3 DB</string>
    <string name="onerom_changelog_850_summary">• Display &amp; Camera: Calibrated front camera switch animation ring coordinates for Galaxy S10 cutout; eliminated SystemUI cutout protection solid black rectangle.\n• Kernel &amp; DVFS: Tuned Mali-G76 MP12 GPU operating frequencies up to 910 MHz with 17 DVFS voltage steps for optimal thermal stability.\n• UI Performance: Integrated EAS schedtune boosting for foreground UI threads on M4 Cheetah cores, eliminating task switching latency.\n• Galaxy AI: Integrated Samsung GenAI suite including Call Assist, Writing Assist, Note Assist, Browsing Assist, and Generative Photo Editing.</string>
